141	sqlserver	instruct	Check backup agent compatibility matrix and obtain compatible version	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "For the installed backup agent: (1) Visit the vendor's compatibility matrix page (e.g., Veeam: veeam.com/kb2443, Commvault: documentation.commvault.com). (2) Find the minimum backup agent version that supports the current SQL Server version and CU level. (3) Download the compatible agent version from the vendor portal. (4) If an upgrade is not yet available, consider rolling back the SQL Server CU or using native SQL Server backup as a temporary workaround. (5) If using Ola Hallengren scripts: update to the latest version from ola.hallengren.com — these scripts are SQL-only and not affected by version mismatch."}	null	low	f	t	01:00:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.103015
