556	sqlserver	instruct	Add ORDER BY or index hints to affected queries to enforce consistent access order	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "For each query with multiple cached plans: (1) Add explicit ORDER BY primary_key to ensure row access order is deterministic. (2) Add index hints (WITH (INDEX(idx_name))) to force a specific index path. (3) For stored procedures, add OPTIMIZE FOR or OPTION (RECOMPILE) where appropriate. (4) Consider adding WITH (ROWLOCK) to reduce escalation surface. Submit changes through normal code review and deployment."}	null	low	f	t	3 days	2026-02-24 13:10:27.153133
