1164	sqlserver	instruct	Identify and validate a witness location in an independent failure domain	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "Determine the failure domains of all existing cluster nodes (physical rack, power circuit, network segment, datacenter). The witness must not share any single point of failure with all cluster nodes simultaneously. Options in order of preference: (1) Cloud Witness using Azure Blob Storage — survives any on-premises datacenter failure, minimal cost. (2) File share on a server in a third physical location (not co-located with Site A or Site B nodes). (3) File share on an Azure Arc-connected machine if cloud witness is not available. Run 'Test-NetConnection -ComputerName <candidate_witness_host> -Port 445' from all cluster nodes to confirm bidirectional reachability."}	null	low	f	t	00:30:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.236543
