1349	sqlserver	instruct	Configure third-party tool to use COPY_ONLY for full backups	{"sql": null, "parameters": ["Third-party tool name and console access", "Chosen authoritative log backup source (native or third-party)"], "description": "In the third-party backup console, locate the SQL Server backup policy for the affected database and enable the COPY_ONLY option for full backups. This prevents the third-party full backup from resetting the differential base LSN and breaking the log chain. If the third-party tool also takes log backups, either: (a) disable its log backups and rely solely on native SQL Server Agent log jobs, or (b) disable native SQL Server Agent log jobs and rely solely on the third-party tool. Mixing log backup sources will always break the chain."}	null	medium	t	t	00:30:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.236783
