2685	sqlserver	configure	Set connection retry with exponential backoff in application connection strings	{"sql": null, "parameters": {"MaxPoolSize": "existing value retained", "MinPoolSize": 2, "ConnectTimeout": 30, "ConnectRetryCount": 3, "ConnectRetryInterval": 10}, "description": "Update application connection strings and pool configuration to use retry-with-jitter. For .NET applications set ConnectRetryCount=3, ConnectRetryInterval=10. For Java (JDBC) set loginTimeout=30 with exponential backoff in the connection factory. Configure pool MinPoolSize to a low value (2-5) so reconnect storms are distributed rather than burst at full pool size."}	{"description": "Revert connection string to previous values if reconnect behavior regresses."}	low	t	t	00:30:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.457062
