3356	sqlserver	verify	Confirm filtered index is used for minority status queries	{"sql": "-- Verify filtered index exists with correct filter definition\\nSELECT i.name, i.has_filter, i.filter_definition, i.is_disabled\\nFROM sys.indexes i\\nWHERE i.object_id = OBJECT_ID('<schema_name>.<table_name>')\\nORDER BY i.type, i.name;\\n\\n-- Test that minority value query uses Index Seek\\nSET STATISTICS IO ON;\\nSELECT TOP 100 *\\nFROM [<schema_name>].[<table_name>]\\nWHERE [<status_column>] = '<minority_value>'\\nOPTION (RECOMPILE);\\nSET STATISTICS IO OFF;", "parameters": {}, "description": "Confirm the filtered index is present with the correct WHERE clause and that minority status queries produce Index Seek plans."}	null	low	f	t	\N	2026-02-24 13:10:27.53974
