4466	sqlserver	instruct	Update deployment guides with hardened security practices	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "Update all internal SQL Server deployment documentation: (1) Replace 'Mixed Mode Authentication' recommendations with 'Windows Authentication Only' as default, with documented exceptions. (2) Remove any instructions to enable sa or use blank passwords. (3) Add mandatory post-installation hardening checklist: disable sa, enforce CHECK_POLICY on all SQL logins, disable xp_cmdshell, disable cross db ownership chaining, disable remote access. (4) Add a section on CIS Benchmark compliance. (5) Include a template SQL script that automates hardening. (6) Version the documentation and flag previous versions as superseded."}	null	low	f	t	04:00:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.750994
