4615	sqlserver	instruct	Migrate to FILE target if using event log, and increase max_file_size	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "If using APPLICATION_LOG or SECURITY_LOG: (1) Create a new FILE-based audit targeting a dedicated audit file directory with sufficient disk space. (2) Set max_file_size to at least 100MB and max_rollover_files to retain 90 days. (3) Migrate existing audit specifications to the new audit. (4) Disable the old event-log-based audit. If already using FILE target: (5) Increase max_file_size if currently set too low. (6) Note that the statement field in FILE audit is limited to 4000 nchar (SQL Server hard limit). (7) For DDL statements exceeding 4000 chars, use Extended Events as a supplemental capture mechanism (xe session with sqlserver.sql_statement_completed event)."}	null	low	t	t	00:30:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.751086
