4647	sqlserver	verify	Identify permission misconfiguration patterns	{"sql": "SELECT\\n  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sys.database_principals dp WHERE dp.type IN ('S','U','G') AND dp.sid <> 0x00 AND dp.principal_id > 4\\n     AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM sys.server_principals sp WHERE sp.sid = dp.sid)) AS orphaned_users,\\n  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sys.database_permissions p WHERE p.state_desc = 'DENY'\\n     AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM sys.database_permissions p2\\n       WHERE p2.grantee_principal_id = p.grantee_principal_id AND p2.major_id = p.major_id AND p2.minor_id = p.minor_id AND p2.state_desc = 'GRANT')) AS conflicting_grant_deny,\\n  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sys.database_principals dp\\n   JOIN sys.database_role_members drm ON dp.principal_id = drm.member_principal_id\\n   JOIN sys.database_principals r ON drm.role_principal_id = r.principal_id\\n   WHERE r.name = 'db_owner'\\n     AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM sys.database_permissions p WHERE p.grantee_principal_id = dp.principal_id AND p.state_desc = 'DENY')) AS db_owner_with_deny;", "parameters": [], "description": "Identifies three categories of permission misconfigurations."}	null	low	f	t	00:01:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.769888
4648	sqlserver	instruct	Remediate misconfigurations and establish training	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "Remediate identified issues: (1) Orphaned users: DROP USER [orphaned_user]; for each orphaned user after confirming they own no schemas or objects. (2) Conflicting GRANT/DENY: For each conflict, determine the intended permission and remove the incorrect one. If DENY is intended, remove the GRANT. If GRANT is intended, remove the DENY. (3) db_owner with DENY: This is almost always a mistake. Either remove db_owner membership or remove the DENY. (4) Redundant grants: Remove direct grants on users who are already db_datareader/db_datawriter/db_owner (role membership already provides the permission). (5) Establish a permission management training program for DBAs covering: role inheritance, DENY precedence, schema ownership, and least privilege. (6) Create a runbook for common permission requests."}	null	medium	t	t	3 days	2026-02-24 13:10:27.769889
