5165	sqlserver	instruct	Benchmark tempdb performance and enable TDE	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "1) Capture baseline tempdb performance metrics (IOPS, latency, wait stats) during peak workload. 2) Enable TDE on a single low-priority database during off-peak hours. 3) Monitor tempdb performance for 24-48 hours after enabling TDE. 4) Compare metrics against baseline. Typical overhead is 3-5% CPU. 5) If overhead is acceptable, enable TDE on remaining databases. 6) If tempdb performance degrades significantly: add tempdb data files, move tempdb to faster storage, or increase CPU capacity. 7) Consider hardware encryption acceleration (AES-NI) if not already in use."}	{"sql": null, "description": "Disable TDE on the test database to revert tempdb to unencrypted state."}	medium	t	t	\N	2026-02-24 13:10:27.853473
