1358	sqlserver	configure	Implement hybrid recovery model strategy for ETL window if PITR required	{"sql": "-- Switch to BULK_LOGGED before ETL window to minimize log generation:\\nALTER DATABASE [<WarehouseDatabase>] SET RECOVERY BULK_LOGGED;\\n\\n-- After ETL completes, take a full or differential backup:\\nBACKUP DATABASE [<WarehouseDatabase>]\\n  TO DISK = N'<BackupPath>\\\\<WarehouseDatabase>_post_etl.bak'\\n  WITH COMPRESSION, CHECKSUM, STATS = 10;\\n\\n-- Switch back to FULL recovery to enable PITR for intraday data:\\nALTER DATABASE [<WarehouseDatabase>] SET RECOVERY FULL;\\n\\n-- Immediately take a log backup to anchor the chain:\\nBACKUP LOG [<WarehouseDatabase>]\\n  TO DISK = N'<BackupPath>\\\\<WarehouseDatabase>_log_post_etl_01.bak'\\n  WITH COMPRESSION, CHECKSUM, STATS = 10;", "parameters": ["<WarehouseDatabase> — data warehouse database name", "<BackupPath> — backup destination path"], "description": "Implements a hybrid approach: switch to BULK_LOGGED during nightly ETL to minimise log volume for bulk inserts, then switch to FULL after ETL completes to enable PITR for intraday activity. Requires these ALTER DATABASE statements to be scripted into the ETL job wrapper."}	{"sql": "ALTER DATABASE [<WarehouseDatabase>] SET RECOVERY SIMPLE;"}	medium	t	t	00:30:00	2026-02-24 13:10:27.236787
4250	sqlserver	instruct	Align load balancer and SQL Server TCP keepalive settings	{"sql": null, "parameters": ["lb_idle_timeout_seconds", "keepalive_seconds"], "description": "Configure the load balancer idle timeout to be longer than the SQL Server TCP keepalive interval. Recommended: SQL Server keepalive = 30 seconds (KeepAliveTime registry key), load balancer idle timeout = 300 seconds. This ensures SQL Server sends keepalive probes before the LB drops the connection. For SQL Server registry: set HKLM\\\\SYSTEM\\\\CurrentControlSet\\\\Services\\\\Tcpip\\\\Parameters\\\\KeepAliveTime to 30000 (milliseconds). For application connection strings, add 'Connection Timeout=15;' to detect unreachable servers quickly. For Azure/AWS load balancers, set the idle timeout to at least 4 minutes. Kill any currently orphaned sessions from LB timeout drops."}	null	low	f	t	\N	2026-02-24 13:10:27.671557
