5855	postgresql	instruct	Schedule DDL during maintenance windows and protect autovacuum	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "To prevent autovacuum cancellation: (1) Schedule DDL operations (ALTER TABLE, CREATE INDEX) during dedicated maintenance windows when autovacuum is not critical. (2) Use lock_timeout on DDL sessions: SET lock_timeout = '5s' before DDL so they fail fast instead of forcing autovacuum cancellation. (3) Run manual VACUUM FREEZE during dedicated maintenance windows when no DDL will interfere. (4) Monitor autovacuum cancellations in PostgreSQL logs: log_autovacuum_min_duration = 0 to log all autovacuum activity."}	\N	low	f	t	1-5 minutes	2026-02-25 08:59:43.77256
