8535	postgresql	instruct	Verify sector alignment and fix configuration	{"parameters": [], "description": "Sector size verification: (1) Check physical sector size: cat /sys/block/sdX/queue/physical_block_size. (2) Check logical sector size: cat /sys/block/sdX/queue/logical_block_size. (3) If physical sector is 4096 (4Kn or 512e drives): ensure filesystem was created with 4K alignment. (4) For ext4: mkfs.ext4 -b 4096. For XFS: mkfs.xfs -s size=4096. (5) Ensure partitions are aligned to 4K boundaries (modern tools do this automatically). (6) full_page_writes = on is especially critical with sector size mismatches as it protects against torn writes at the WAL level."}	\N	low	f	t	5-30 minutes	2026-02-25 08:59:43.77256
