8549	postgresql	instruct	Diagnose and resolve network congestion	{"parameters": [], "description": "Network storage troubleshooting: (1) Check network interface errors and drops: ip -s link show :iface. (2) Verify dedicated storage network (do not share with application traffic). (3) Check for MTU mismatches (jumbo frames = 9000). (4) For iSCSI: verify multipath I/O is configured. (5) For NFS: check mount options (sync, hard, rsize=1048576, wsize=1048576). (6) Check switch port utilization and errors. (7) Verify network bandwidth is sufficient for peak I/O load. (8) Consider bonding/LACP for increased bandwidth."}	\N	low	f	t	5-30 minutes	2026-02-25 08:59:43.77256
