8552	postgresql	instruct	Isolate database I/O from contention	{"parameters": [], "description": "Storage contention resolution: (1) Request dedicated LUNs for PostgreSQL on the SAN (not shared with other servers). (2) Configure storage QoS (Quality of Service) to prioritize database I/O. (3) For cloud: use provisioned IOPS storage (AWS io2, Azure Premium SSD) instead of burstable. (4) Separate WAL and data onto different LUNs/volumes. (5) Schedule heavy batch jobs during off-peak hours when array contention is lower. (6) Consider migrating to local NVMe storage for the highest performance requirements."}	\N	low	f	t	5-30 minutes	2026-02-25 08:59:43.77256
