6128	postgresql	instruct	Resolve data inconsistency on subscriber	{"sql": null, "parameters": [], "description": "Based on the conflict type: (1) Duplicate key: DELETE the conflicting row on the subscriber before retrying, (2) Missing row for UPDATE/DELETE: INSERT the row or skip the change using ALTER SUBSCRIPTION sub_name SKIP (lsn = 'LSN_VALUE') in PG15+, (3) For severe inconsistency: Drop and recreate the subscription to force a full resync, (4) For ongoing conflicts: Set the subscription's conflict handler or fix the application logic causing divergence."}	\N	medium	t	f	5-60 minutes	2026-02-25 08:59:43.77256
