8074	postgresql	instruct	Rewind standby to follow new timeline	{"sql": null, "parameters": ["primary_host"], "description": "On the diverged standby: 1) Stop PostgreSQL: sudo systemctl stop postgresql. 2) Use pg_rewind: pg_rewind --target-pgdata=/var/lib/postgresql/data --source-server='host=:primary_host port=5432 user=replication dbname=postgres'. 3) Update recovery configuration to follow new timeline: set recovery_target_timeline='latest' in postgresql.conf. 4) Create standby.signal. 5) Start PostgreSQL: sudo systemctl start postgresql."}	\N	medium	t	f	minutes	2026-02-25 08:59:43.77256
